title: Oriol Junqueras, dethroned ?!
subtitle: The recent move by ERC to push him out of the party's advisory board raises questions on his future role as party leader.
view-if: player_party = "erc" and year > 2012 and not junqueras_dethroned and oriol_junqueras_advisor_available = 1 and oriol_junqueras_advisor = 0
tags: event
role: event
new-page: true
face-image: img/events/junqueras_dethroned.jpeg
on-arrival: {!
    // TODO: think more about this: what requires each of them to run, etc. Historically it was not so straight forward??

    // Snapshot the contest before its own electoral disruption. No random draws.
    if (Q.erc_primary) return;
    var factions = ["left", "core", "pragmatic", "civic"];
    var weights = factions.map(function (f) { return Math.max(0, Number(Q["erc_" + f + "_strength"]) || 0); });
    var total = weights.reduce(function (sum, n) { return sum + n; }, 0);
    weights = total ? weights.map(function (n) { return n / total; }) : [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25];
    var candidates = [
        {id:"oriol_junqueras", name:"Oriol Junqueras", gender:"m", colour:"var(--erc)", appeal:[1,1.4,1.1,1]},
        {id:"marta_rovira", name:"Marta Rovira", gender:"f", colour:"#B96E55", appeal:[50,50,25,20]},
        {id:"pere_aragones", name:"Pere Aragonès", gender:"m", colour:"#A9821F", appeal:[10,15,55,5]},
        {id:"raul_romeva", name:"Raül Romeva", gender:"m", colour:"#8C7355", appeal:[35,30,20,40]},
        {id:"carme_forcadell", name:"Carme Forcadell", gender:"f", colour:"#D5B56A", appeal:[10,10,2,40]}
    ].filter(function (c, i) {
        return i == 0 || (Q[c.id + "_advisor_available"] == 1 && !Q[c.id + "_departed"] && (c.id != "pere_aragones" || Q.year >= 2019));
    });
    var roadmap = Number(Q.erc_roadmap) || 0;
    for (var c of candidates.slice(1)) {
        if (c.id == "pere_aragones") c.appeal[3] *= roadmap >= 3 ? 0.25 : roadmap >= 2 ? 0.5 : 1;
        if (c.id == "carme_forcadell") {
            c.appeal[1] *= roadmap >= 2 ? 1.25 : 0.75;
            c.appeal[3] *= 1 + Math.max(0, (weights[3] - 0.35) * 2);
            c.appeal[2] *= roadmap >= 2 ? 0.5 : 1;
        }
        // Dissent helps compatible alternatives; anger at dismissing Junqueras
        // must not automatically turn the Core into votes against him.
        for (var f = 0; f < factions.length; f++) {
            var discontent = Math.max(0, Math.min(0.5, ((Number(Q["erc_" + factions[f] + "_dissent"]) || 0) - 30) / 50));
            if ((f == 0 && ["marta_rovira", "raul_romeva"].includes(c.id)) ||
                (f == 2 && c.id == "pere_aragones") || (f == 3 && c.id == "carme_forcadell")) c.appeal[f] *= 1 + discontent;
        }
    }
    // Count ERC's attributed representatives, not its empty standalone ballot.
    var seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.erc_parlament_s) || 0);
    var carrier = "erc", ercShare = 1;
    for (var list of ["jxsi", "jxcat"]) {
        if (!Q["erc_in_" + list]) continue;
        carrier = list;
        var remainder = Q["cup_in_" + list] ? 1 - (Number(Q[list + "_cup_formation_num"]) || 0) / 100 : 1;
        ercShare = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, remainder * (Number(Q[list + "_formation_num"]) || 50) / 100));
        seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q[list + "_parlament_s"]) || 0) * ercShare;
        break;
    }
    var trust = Number.isFinite(Number(Q.independence_trust)) ? Number(Q.independence_trust) : 50;
    var trustEffect = Math.max(-16, Math.min(16, (trust - 50) * 0.4));
    var electoralEffect = seats > 40 ? 12 : seats > 30 ? 8 : seats < 15 ? -10 : 0;
    var record = {factions:factions, weights:weights, candidates:candidates, seats:seats,
        trust:trust, trustEffect:trustEffect, electoralEffect:electoralEffect, roadmap:roadmap,
        first:[], runoff:[], started:false, resolved:false};
    for (var c of candidates) record.first.push({id:c.id, share:0, factions:[0,0,0,0]});
    for (var f = 0; f < factions.length; f++) {
        // At the initial 20:40:20:30 faction balance, the neutral incumbent wins 60%.
        var incumbent = candidates.length == 1 ? 100 : Math.max(5, Math.min(90, [55,70,60,50][f] + trustEffect + electoralEffect));
        var alternatives = candidates.slice(1).reduce(function (sum, c) { return sum + c.appeal[f]; }, 0);
        record.first[0].factions[f] = weights[f] * incumbent;
        for (var i = 1; i < candidates.length; i++) record.first[i].factions[f] = weights[f] * (100 - incumbent) * candidates[i].appeal[f] / alternatives;
    }
    Q.erc_primary = record;
    Q.erc_primary_needs_runoff = false;
    Q.erc_primary_has_challenger = candidates.length > 1;
    Q.erc_primary_displaced_advisor = "";
    // Small, conserving demobilization, limited to ERC's share of a shared list.
    for (var province of Q.parlament_constituencies) for (var demographic of Q.parlament_demographics) {
        var stock = Number(Q[carrier + "_parlament_" + province + "_" + demographic + "_support"]) || 0;
        if (stock > 0) G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", from:carrier, to:"abstain", amount:stock * 0.01 * ercShare,
            maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:[province], demographics:[demographic]});
    }
!}

= ​Oriol Junqueras, dethroned ?!

ERC has recently re-structured the party's advisory board and, in quite the controversial move, it seems like Oriol Junqueras, undisputed party leader since the collapse of the Triparite government in 2010, has been pushed to the sidelines. One wonders if his leadership may be indeed living its last moments. When pressed, he has admitted to be considering his role within the party, and has hinted at the possibility of seeking a re-election through an extraordinary primary. If that is the case, we'll have to see to what extent the republican militancy still trusts his leadership after all...

- @wait_no
- @start_push_out

@wait_no
title: Wait a second, let's reconsider this
subtitle: Oriol Junqueras will return to the party's advisory board.
on-arrival: erc_primary_seat = "oriol_junqueras"
call: junqueras_dethroned.seat_leader

It may be better to reconsider after all... Oriol Junqueras has rejoined the advisory board.

#  [? if erc_primary_displaced_advisor: To make space for him, [+ erc_primary_displaced_advisor +] has stepped aside, at least for now.?]

- @cancel: Continue...

@cancel
on-arrival: {! Q.erc_primary = null; !}
go-to: post_event

@start_push_out
title: It may be the time for new leaderships
subtitle: A primary election will have to solve any disputes. \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1 and erc_primary_has_challenger and not year < 2013 and not rubicon
unavailable-subtitle: [? if year < 2013 or rubicon: Given the current political circumstances, the party feels like it is not the right time to open a debate on leadership. ?][? if not erc_primary_has_challenger: There really isn't an alternative candidate... ?] [? if party_resources < 1 and erc_primary_has_challenger: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (!Q.erc_primary.started) {
        Q.party_resources -= 1;
        Q.erc_primary.started = true;
        Q.erc_primary_first_round = null;
        Q.erc_primary_second_round = null;
    }
    Q.erc_primary_campaign_runoff = false;
    Q.erc_primary_endorsement = "";
!}

After critical voices within the party have defended the recent move to exclude him from the party's advisory board, and in quite the controversial move, Oriol Junqueras has officially resigned from the party's presidency. In his own words, to be able to fairly seek re-election by the militancy. With the whole process of leadership renovation underway within ERC, however, he will clearly not be running alone.

